```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as 👤 Client
    participant Nginx as ⚖️ Nginx
    participant UserSvc as 🔐 User Service
    participant DocSvc as 📄 Document Service
    participant SearchSvc as 🔍 Search Service
    participant Queue as 📬 RabbitMQ
    participant Indexer as ⚙️ Indexer Worker
    participant Cache as 💾 ValKey
    participant DB as 🗄️ PostgreSQL
    participant Audit as 📋 Audit Service

    Note over Client,Audit: 1. User Registration & Authentication
    Client->>+Nginx: POST /api/users/register
    Nginx->>+UserSvc: Forward request
    UserSvc->>+DB: INSERT INTO users
    DB-->>-UserSvc: User created
    UserSvc->>Audit: Emit "user.created" event
    UserSvc-->>-Nginx: 201 Created + JWT token
    Nginx-->>-Client: Response

    Note over Client,Audit: 2. Upload Document
    Client->>+Nginx: POST /api/documents (+ JWT)
    Nginx->>+DocSvc: Forward request
    DocSvc->>UserSvc: Validate JWT token
    UserSvc-->>DocSvc: Token valid
    DocSvc->>+DB: INSERT INTO documents
    DB-->>-DocSvc: Document created
    DocSvc->>Queue: Publish indexing task
    Queue-->>DocSvc: Task queued
    DocSvc->>Audit: Emit "document.created" event
    DocSvc-->>-Nginx: 201 Created
    Nginx-->>-Client: Document uploaded

    Note over Client,Audit: 3. Asynchronous Indexing
    Queue->>+Indexer: Consume indexing task
    Indexer->>DB: SELECT document content
    DB-->>Indexer: Document data
    Indexer->>Indexer: Tokenize & compute TF-IDF
    Indexer->>+DB: INSERT INTO terms, postings
    DB-->>-Indexer: Index updated
    Indexer->>Cache: Invalidate search cache
    Cache-->>Indexer: Cache cleared
    Indexer-->>-Queue: ACK task

    Note over Client,Audit: 4. Search Query (Cache MISS)
    Client->>+Nginx: GET /api/search?q=test
    Nginx->>+SearchSvc: Forward request
    SearchSvc->>+Cache: GET cache_key
    Cache-->>-SearchSvc: MISS
    SearchSvc->>+DB: SELECT from terms, postings (Standby)
    DB-->>-SearchSvc: Search results
    SearchSvc->>+Cache: SET cache_key (TTL 5min)
    Cache-->>-SearchSvc: Cached
    SearchSvc->>Audit: Emit "search.executed" event
    SearchSvc-->>-Nginx: 200 OK + results
    Nginx-->>-Client: Search results

    Note over Client,Audit: 5. Search Query (Cache HIT)
    Client->>+Nginx: GET /api/search?q=test
    Nginx->>+SearchSvc: Forward request
    SearchSvc->>+Cache: GET cache_key
    Cache-->>-SearchSvc: HIT (cached results)
    SearchSvc-->>-Nginx: 200 OK + results (X-Cache: HIT)
    Nginx-->>-Client: Fast response

    Note over Client,Audit: 6. Event Sourcing - Replay
    Client->>+Nginx: GET /audit/replay/document/{id}
    Nginx->>+Audit: Forward request
    Audit->>+DB: SELECT * FROM events WHERE aggregate_id
    DB-->>-Audit: All events (created, updated, deleted)
    Audit->>Audit: Replay events to build state
    Audit-->>-Nginx: Current state reconstructed
    Nginx-->>-Client: Document state at any point in time
```
